ngji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e5100d81191ed5dea2e21de1390d9ca39c488f9ab762a137721e677242596b90","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (8分)如图是一个呈葫芦形的导热玻璃瓶,为测量其内部容积,在瓶口插入一根两端开口的玻璃管,接口用蜜蜡密封.玻璃管竖直放置,横截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S=1.0\\ cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,质量m=2g的油柱(密度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho=0.8\\ g/cm^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" )将一定质量理想气体封闭在瓶内.油柱静止时,玻璃管中空气柱长度L=2cm,此时外界温度T=300K.将玻璃瓶浸入温度为2T的热液中,油柱再次静止时下方空气柱长度变为10L.已知气体内能变化满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=k\\Delta T"},{"type":"text","value":" (k为常量, "},{"type":"math","value":"k=8\\times10^{-3}\\ J/K"},{"type":"text","value":" ),环境温度和外界气压恒定,油未溢出.求:\n(1)若将玻璃瓶改为浸入冰水中达到平衡后:气体分子平均动能（填空）(选填“增大”“不变”或“减小”),玻璃瓶内气体分子的数密度（填空）(选填“增大”“不变”或“减小”);\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5334cb4f98cbd37c3cebea1b5741511998c9b3f9237b9195b249327482270336.png","width":227,"height":385,"width_mm":26.599,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)玻璃瓶内部的容积 V;\n(3)若外界气压 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":" Pa, 求温度从 T 升至 2T 过程中, 气体吸收的热量.\n[第(3)题结果要求保留2位有效数字]\n\n原卷公共参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^\\circ=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos37^\\circ=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.(8分)\n(1)微观量分析\n气体分子平均动能:温度降低,分子平均动能→减小 (1分)\n葫芦形瓶内气体分子的数密度:气体分布均匀,平衡后各状态参量保持稳定"},{"type":"math","value":"n=N/V,N_{\\text{瓶}}\\text{↑},V_{\\text{瓶}}"},{"type":"text","value":"不变,"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{\\text{瓶}}\\rightarrow"},{"type":"text","value":"增大.\n或考虑:"},{"type":"math","value":"N_{\\text{总}}=N_{\\text{瓶}}+N_{\\text{管}},N_{\\text{总}}"},{"type":"text","value":"不变,"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{\\text{总}}\\text{↓},n_{\\text{总}}\\text{↑},n_{\\text{瓶}}=n_{\\text{总}},n_{\\text{瓶}}\\rightarrow"},{"type":"text","value":"增大 (1分)\n(2)容积计算\n花瓶连同玻璃管内的气体做等压变化,由盖—吕萨克定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V+SL}{T}=\\frac{V+S\\cdot10L}{2T}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\nV=16 mL (1分)\n(3)热量Q计算\n花瓶内气体压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p=p_{0}+\\frac{mg}{S}=1.002\\times10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"Pa\n气体温度升高"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta T=T"},{"type":"text","value":"气体膨胀过程中,外界对气体做功为"},{"type":"math","value":"W=-pS\\cdot(10L-L)=-1.8036J"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n气体内能的变化为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=k\\Delta T=k\\cdot T=2.4J"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=W+Q"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\Delta U-W=4.2J"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"66ba3deeb73f41dbf9000f0e27637e24d9e57261ac7d0b707672c297de3c0a7a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. (11 分)如图所示为半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=1.25\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的四分之一竖直圆弧轨道 AB、传送带 BC、水平轨道 CDE 平滑连接组成的模型，E 端的竖直挡板上固定有劲度系数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"k=3.2\\ N/m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的轻质弹簧。现将质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=0.1\\ kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小物块 a 从圆心 O 等高处 A 点静止释放, 经过水平传送带 BC 后, 与静止在轨道 D 处、质量也为 m 的物块 b 发生碰撞, 碰撞后结合为一整体. 初始时 b 与弹簧接触但不粘连. 已知传送带的长度 L = 2 m, 以 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = 4 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" 顺时针匀速转动. CD 之间的距离 l = 0.2 m, 两物块与传送带间的动摩擦因数均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其余部分均光滑，物块可视为质点，弹簧振子做简谐运动的周期 "},{"type":"math","value":"T = 2\\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" 为弹簧的劲度系数）.求：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1312dbae6a54736326a1460c08d6b6943b9dc2b8e3655119a1d5bc24e2e8d9f0.png","width":638,"height":153,"width_mm":75.001,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)物块 a 第一次滑过传送带, 摩擦力对滑块的冲量;\n(2)a、b两物块结合压缩弹簧至最短后,第 101 回到 D 处的时间(取 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\pi=3"},{"type":"text","value":" );\n(3)物块 a 从静止释放到第 n 次经过 D 处时,系统摩擦产生的热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{n}"},{"type":"text","value":" .\n\n原卷公共参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^\\circ=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos37^\\circ=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.(1)滑块a从A滑到B根据动能定理,有"},{"type":"math","value":"mgR=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=5~m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n物块滑到传送带上时,根据牛顿第二定律,有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu mg=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"解得加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"a=5~m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"当物块速度减为4 m/s时,"},{"type":"math","value":"v^{2}-v_{0}^{2}=-2ax"},{"type":"text","value":"解得运动的位移为x=0.9m<L (1分)\n由此可知物块在传送带上运动时将会与传送带共速.\n物块a第一次与传送带共速的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":",则有"},{"type":"math","value":"v=v_{0}-at_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=0.2~s"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\mu mgt_1"},{"type":"text","value":"解得冲量大小为 0.1 N·s，方向沿传送带向左（1分）\n(2)a以4 m/s第一次碰b物块,满足动量守恒,有"},{"type":"math","value":"mv=(m+m)v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":".\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=2~m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\nab做简谐运动,再次回到D点所用的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t_1=\\frac12 T=\\frac12\\times 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{2m}{k}}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\,\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n弹回后在传送带上向左运动的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"x'=\\frac{v_{1}^{2}}{2a}=0.4\\ m<L"},{"type":"text","value":"根据运动的对称性可知 ab 以 2 m/s 向右离开传送带，再次回到 D 所经历的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t_2=2\\left(\\frac{l}{v_1}+\\frac{v_1}{a}\\right)=1.0\\,\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"所以 a、b 第一次和第三次到达 D 的时间间隔为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t=\\left(1.0+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n设"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"为一个循环所需时间。第1次至第101次到达D共50次循环，所以这段时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t'=50\\Delta t=87.5\\,\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"。从弹簧压缩最短至第一次返回D还需四分之一周期"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{T}{4}=0.375\\,\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故总时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t=87.875\\,\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"(3) 物块 a 第一次与传送带共速的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"v = v_{0} - a t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{5-4}{5}\\ s=0.2\\ s"},{"type":"text","value":"物块 a 运动的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=\\frac{v_{0}+v}{2}t_{1}=0.9\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":"传送带运动的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}=vt_{1}=0.8m"},{"type":"text","value":"物块 a 相对传送带运动的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = x_{1} - x_{2} = 0.1 \\, m"},{"type":"text","value":"联立解得物块 a 第一次滑过传送带系统摩擦产生的热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1}=\\mu mg\\Delta x=0.05\\ J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n碰撞后 ab 以 2 m/s 向左滑上传送带，速度减为零时，所用的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1=\\frac{v_1}{a}=0.4"},{"type":"text","value":"s\n向左运动的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=\\frac{v_{1}^{2}}{2a}=0.4\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":"传送带运动的位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}'=vt_{1}=1.6\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":"此过程的相对位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x'=x_{1}+x_{1}'=2\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":"物块反向加速时与传送带产生的相对位移为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x''=\\left(v-\\frac{v_1}{2}\\right)t_1=1.2\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"这个过程产生的热量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{2}=2\\mu mg(\\Delta x^{''}+\\Delta x')=3.2\\ J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n分类讨论：\n若 n 为奇数"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=Q_{1}+\\frac{(n-1)}{2}Q_{2}=\\left[0.05+1.6(n-1)\\right]J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n若 n 为偶数"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=Q_{1}+\\frac{n-2}{2}Q_{2}=\\left[0.05+1.6(n-2)\\right]J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"826a8f15c02f7a3fe0c73244af5e2b447a9ed51476a089346e1f6552f2e91852","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12分)如图所示,水平面内固定有相互平行的abcd和ABCD两条光滑导轨,两导轨相距d=0.5m,ab段与AB段长度相同且分别与cd段和CD段绝缘,绝缘位置左右两段导轨均足够长,导轨左端与直流电源相连,电源电动势E=1.5V,两根长度均为d=0.5m的导体棒M、N分别放置在abAB段和cdCD段上,与导轨垂直且接触良好.两导体棒质量均为m=2kg,电阻均为R=2"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":",两导轨所在区域存在与导轨平面垂直的匀强磁场,磁感应强度大小为B=1T.现闭合开关S,导体棒M向右运动,到达bB端前已经匀速.不计 ab、cd 与 AB、CD 段电阻,设运动过程中两棒不会相撞.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1cc3041ebee1313bae0893649f4b3469c94691c353a3910e6decf514ff521028.png","width":405,"height":225,"width_mm":47.554,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)求导体棒 M 进入 cdCD 段时的速率 v;\n(2)求导体棒 N 的最大速率 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 及到达最大速度时产生的焦耳热；\n(3) 计算导体棒 M 进入 cdCD 段后到最终稳定的过程中, 流过导体棒的电荷量及两导体棒相互靠近的距离."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(1)当导体棒 M 的感应电动势与电源电动势相等后,速率将不再变化,即"},{"type":"math","value":"E=Bdv"},{"type":"text","value":"(2 分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=3\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(2)导体棒 M 进入 cdCD 段后,两棒组成的系统动量守恒,当两者速度相同时,N棒速度最大"},{"type":"math","value":"mv=2mv_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=1.5\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n最终以相同速率"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=1.5\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"匀速运动\n设导体棒 M 和导体棒 N 系统产生的焦耳热为 Q,根据能量守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}=2\\times\\frac{1}{2}mv_{m}^{2}+Q"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n解得 Q = 4.5 J (1 分)\n(3)最终以相同速率"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=1.5\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"匀速运动\n对 M 棒,"},{"type":"math","value":"Bid\\Delta t=m\\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"Bd\\Delta q=m\\Delta v"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta q=6\\ C"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n研究导体棒构成的回路"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{\\Delta\\Phi}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"i=\\frac{E}{R_{\\text{总}}}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta q=i\\Delta t"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta q=\\frac{\\Delta\\Phi}{R_{\\text{总}}}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta q=\\frac{Bd\\Delta x}{R_{\\text{总}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x=48\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"902f513420755ec02456d217c3c0e8c3873e7aab3ab5f4730167a6f249298b40","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13分)如图(a)所示,在矩形MNPQ区域内存在周期性变化的匀强电场,电场的变化规律如图(b)所示,电场方向由M指向N时为正方向.在MQ上方存在方向垂直纸面向里的磁场区域I,NP下方存在方向垂直纸面向外的磁场区域Ⅱ,磁感应强度大小均为B且磁场区域足够大.在MN的中点S处有一电子发射源,可以源源不断地发出质量为m、电荷量为-e、速度方向与MN垂直、大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电子.QP上有一电子吸收板.已知, "},{"type":"math","value":"MN=d,MQ=2d,B=\\frac{\\pi mv_{0}}{ed},T=\\frac{2d}{v_{0}},\\pi\\approx3"},{"type":"text","value":" ,且电子重力不计.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1244d947c897092806cccb31ab855162a8bb84dec70e088e60f6841aca64c4fc.png","width":284,"height":398,"width_mm":33.337,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-gaosan-liankao-2508-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(a)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"imag