\\frac{eE_{0}}{m} t = v_{0}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\theta = \\frac{v_y}{v_0} = 1"},{"type":"text","value":"故合速度及入射角为"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\sqrt{v_0^2 + v_y^2} = \\sqrt{2} v_0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"因此由几何关系可知，粒子在磁场中运动轨迹为四分之一圆周.电子在磁场中做匀速圆周运动，有"},{"type":"math","value":"evB = m\\frac{v^2}{r}"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1 = \\frac{T'}{4} = \\frac{\\pi r}{2v}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"r = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\pi} d,t_1 = \\frac{d}{2v_0} = \\frac{T}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"故有"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1} = \\sqrt{2} r = \\frac{2}{\\pi} d"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2} = d - x_{1} = \\frac{\\pi - 2}{\\pi} d"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"t _ {2} = \\frac {x _ {2}}{v _ {0}} = \\frac {(\\pi - 2) d}{\\pi v _ {0}} <   \\frac {T}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"所以电子在电场中运动时电场方向为正方向，且方向未发生变化.因此电子向上做匀加速直线运动，有"},{"type":"math","value":"y = v_{0}t_{2} + \\frac{1}{2}\\frac{eE_{0}}{m} t_{2}^{2} = \\frac{3\\pi^{2} - 8\\pi + 4}{2\\pi^{2}} d\\approx \\frac{7}{18} d <   d"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"因此电子不会进入磁场区域 I，直接打在吸收板距 P 点"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{7}{18}d"},{"type":"text","value":"处；"},{"type":"text","value":"(4) 假设在电场中加速时间为 t 的电子恰好打在 P 点，在电场中运动的水平位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=v_{0}t"},{"type":"text","value":"进入磁场时竖直方向的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}=at=\\frac{eE}{m}t"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据从 MN 中点出发且恰好经过 NP 中点的条件，有"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{mv_0^2}{ed}"},{"type":"text","value":"进入磁场后"},{"type":"math","value":"ev_xB\\Delta t=m\\Delta v_y"},{"type":"text","value":"。电子恰好从磁场到达 P 点时，有"},{"type":"math","value":"eB\\Delta x=m\\cdot2v_y"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"x _ {1} + \\Delta x = 2 d"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{2\\pi d}{(2 + \\pi)v_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n射出的电子在电场